### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts

### Get single contact by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/69aa60339ef8d3311f0852b3

### Create a new contact
POST http://localhost:8080/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "email": "john.smith@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "green",
  "birthday": "1995-03-10"
}

### Update a contact by ID
PUT http://localhost:8080/contacts/69bb0abae20f147e8f691775
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "email": "john.updated@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "red",
  "birthday": "1995-03-10"
}

### Delete a contact by ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/contacts/69bb0abae20f147e8f691775

